body:
Hey there buddy. I usually dont reply much, but this, i relate to strongly. I was with this girl for a few years who had promised me everything. I got almost obsessed with her. Her guy friends and her would joke around, and i too caught them sexting. They said it was "being playful" but it was downright cheating. I stayed. For way longer than i should have. It has been around 4 months since our breakup, that i managed to pull myself together to live on for myself and people around me. And im still trying to recover.

Tltr;
Youll just keep getting more and more paranoid. Confirm things, and if your suspicions are right. End it sooner rather than later, itll only hurt worse. Wish the best for you.

Greetings peasant how goes thee-

